0000 - GET IN TOUCH WITH THE CONTACT BY ENTERING HER BUILDING
0001
0002 - TAKE HER TO THE CLUB AND WAIT FOR THE GENERAL TO WALK IN 
0003
0004 - THE GESTAPO OFFICERS MAY BE ABLE TO IDENTIFY THE CONTACT
0005
0006 - STEAL THE DOCUMENTS
0007
0008 - TO ESCAPE, STEAL THE BOAT LOCATED AT THE WESTERN DOCK 
0009   AND HEAD EAST
0010 %k#end of text marker
DATE DEC 18, 1944
PLAC NIJMEGEN, HOLLAND
TITL DANGEROUS FRIENDSHIPS
